-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §46 הפרשות לקופת גמל לקצבה: from תשע"ב
-- every salary component paid to a teaching employee carries pension
-- provident fund contributions at the rates customary for "pension
-- components", save the evaluation and achievement grants, expense
-- reimbursements, the clothing allowance and the tax gross-up and
-- imputation; that replaces the agreement of 17.12.98's non-annuity
-- contributions, which go on for the reimbursements and the clothing
-- allowance alone; in a fund that is not an old pension fund, the
-- employer's contribution for benefits is 6.5% from 1.1.2011 and 7% from
-- 1.1.2013 (from the day a teacher came under the reform in full, if
-- earlier), the teacher's deduction grows twice by half a point up to 5.5%
-- and 6%, and the contribution in place of severance is 8 1/3% from תשע"ב,
-- in place of all the severance pay; and one insured in an old fund may ask
-- for another fund.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-37`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-v`

§ `46 הפרשות לקופת גמל לקצבה`

DECLARE `Oz section 46 action` IS ONE OF
    `contribute for the teacher to another pension provident fund in place of the old pension fund`

-- What §46(א) and its exceptions tell apart among the components paid to
-- a teaching employee. §37's alternative allocation and annex ו's special
-- reward are named apart because §46(א) does not name them
-- (F-oz-founding-46-a).
@desc A salary component paid to a teaching employee, as §46(א) tells them apart.
DECLARE `Oz salary component paid` IS ONE OF
    `the evaluation grant of section 35`
    `the school-achievement grant of section 36`
    `the alternative allocation of section 37`
    `the special reward of annex ו's special contract`
    `an expense reimbursement`
    `the clothing allowance`
    `a tax gross-up`
    `a benefit imputed for tax`
    `another salary component`

-- The kinds of pension provident fund (ד) and (ה) tell apart: an old
-- pension fund ("קרן פנסיה ותיקה") and any other pension provident fund.
DECLARE `Oz teacher's pension fund` IS ONE OF
    `an old pension fund`
    `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund`

-- How a component's pension contributions are made, by the provision that
-- governs them.
DECLARE `pension contributions on an Oz component` IS ONE OF
    `at the rates customary for pension components`
    `under the agreement of 17.12.98, at its rates`
    `at the 5% and 5% the component's own section sets`
    `none under section 46`

§§ `46(א)`

-- (א): from the school year תשע"ב (1.9.2011; convention dates.start),
-- contributions to a pension provident fund are made on every salary
-- component paid to the teaching employee, save the evaluation grant (§35),
-- the school-achievement grant (§36), expense reimbursement, the clothing
-- allowance, the tax gross-up and the benefit imputed for tax, at the rates
-- customary for "pension components", as the section goes on to set out.
-- The exceptions are a closed list (convention reading.closed-list): §37's
-- alternative allocation and annex ו's special reward are not among them.
@ref akn:art_46__para_a
`section 46 applies from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011

GIVEN c IS AN `Oz salary component paid`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 46(א) excepts` c IF
        c EQUALS `the evaluation grant of section 35`
    OR c EQUALS `the school-achievement grant of section 36`
    OR c EQUALS `an expense reimbursement`
    OR c EQUALS `the clothing allowance`
    OR c EQUALS `a tax gross-up`
    OR c EQUALS `a benefit imputed for tax`

GIVEN d IS A DATE, c IS AN `Oz salary component paid`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 46(א) brings into the pension fund on` d c IF
        d `is on or after` `section 46 applies from`
    AND NOT `section 46(א) excepts` c

§§ `46(ב)–(ג)`

-- (ב): on a component (א) brings in that, on the eve of the signing, carried
-- contributions to a provident fund "לא משלמת לקצבה" under the collective
-- agreement of 17.12.98, (א)'s contributions take the place of that
-- agreement's from 1.9.2011. (ג): on expense reimbursements and the
-- clothing allowance, the contribution "לקופת גמל לקצבה" goes on under the
-- agreement of 17.12.98, at its rates. The tax gross-up and the benefit
-- imputed for tax are in neither: §46 brings no contribution on them (the
-- agreement of 17.12.98 excepts them from its own, §5(א)).
--
-- F-oz-founding-46-b: (ב) calls the fund the agreement of 17.12.98 paid
-- into a provident fund that does not pay an annuity, and (ג) has the same
-- agreement's contribution "go on" to a pension provident fund. The
-- reading adopted (convention precedence.specific): (ג), which speaks of
-- these two components, sends their contribution to a pension provident
-- fund, at the agreement of 17.12.98's rates.
--
-- F-oz-founding-46-a: (א) does not except §37's alternative allocation,
-- whose own (ג) sets contributions of 5% and 5%, as §§35(ח) and 36(י) do
-- for the grants (א) does except; nor the special reward of annex ו's
-- contract, a "תוספת שכר" whose contract's §4(ד) sets 5% and 5% too. The
-- reading adopted (convention precedence.specific): the provision that
-- speaks of the component alone.
@ref akn:art_46__para_b akn:art_46__para_c
GIVEN d IS A DATE, c IS AN `Oz salary component paid`
GIVETH A MAYBE `pension contributions on an Oz component`
DECIDE `the pension contributions section 46 makes on` d c IS
    IF d `is on or after` `section 46 applies from`
    THEN JUST
            (BRANCH
                IF c EQUALS `the evaluation grant of section 35` THEN `at the 5% and 5% the component's own section sets`
                IF c EQUALS `the school-achievement grant of section 36` THEN `at the 5% and 5% the component's own section sets`
                IF c EQUALS `the alternative allocation of section 37` THEN `at the 5% and 5% the component's own section sets`
                IF c EQUALS `the special reward of annex ו's special contract` THEN `at the 5% and 5% the component's own section sets`
                IF c EQUALS `an expense reimbursement` THEN `under the agreement of 17.12.98, at its rates`
                IF c EQUALS `the clothing allowance` THEN `under the agreement of 17.12.98, at its rates`
                IF c EQUALS `a tax gross-up` THEN `none under section 46`
                IF c EQUALS `a benefit imputed for tax` THEN `none under section 46`
                OTHERWISE `at the rates customary for pension components`)
    ELSE NOTHING

-- (ב): from 1.9.2011 the agreement of 17.12.98's contributions on a
-- component (א) brings in end, (א)'s taking their place.
GIVEN d IS A DATE, c IS AN `Oz salary component paid`
      `carried the 17.12.98 agreement's contributions on the eve` IS A BOOLEAN @desc to a provident fund that does not pay an annuity, on the eve of the signing
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 46(ב) replaces the 17.12.98 agreement's contributions on` d c `carried the 17.12.98 agreement's contributions on the eve` IF
        `carried the 17.12.98 agreement's contributions on the eve`
    AND `section 46(א) brings into the pension fund on` d c

`why the agreement of 17.12.98's rates are not here` MEANS
    `not yet encoded` "ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 17.12.98 (ארגון המורים), הפרשה לקופת גמל בגין רכיבי שכר שאינם פנסיוניים"

-- The fund each of (ב) and (ג) says the agreement of 17.12.98 paid into.
DECLARE `kind of provident fund` IS ONE OF
    `a provident fund that does not pay an annuity`
    `a pension provident fund`

`the fund section 46(ב) says the 17.12.98 agreement paid into` MEANS `a provident fund that does not pay an annuity`
`the fund section 46(ג) has the 17.12.98 agreement's contribution go on to` MEANS `a pension provident fund`

§§ `46(ד)`

-- (ד): the rates of contribution to a pension provident fund that is not
-- an old pension fund, on the salary insured for an accrual pension. Each
-- day is in the period it opens (convention dates.start).
-- (1) from 1.1.2011 the employer's contribution for benefits is 6.5%;
-- (2) from 1.1.2013, 7%;
-- (3) a teaching employee employed on the reform's terms in full before
-- 1.1.2013 has (2) from the day he began to be so employed. (After
-- 1.1.2013 (2) holds for everyone, so the day only matters before it.)
-- Before 1.1.2011 §46 sets no rate, nor for an old pension fund, whose
-- rates are the ones customary for pension components there.
@ref akn:art_46__para_d akn:art_46__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_46__para_d__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_46__para_d__subpara_2 akn:art_46__para_d__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_46__para_d__subpara_3
`the first day of section 46(ד)(1)` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011
`the first day of section 46(ד)(2)` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `under the reform in full from` IS A MAYBE DATE @desc the day the teacher began to be employed on the reform's terms in full; NOTHING if he has not
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 46(ד)(2) applies on` d `under the reform in full from` IF
        d `is on or after` `the first day of section 46(ד)(2)`
    OR (CONSIDER `under the reform in full from`
        WHEN JUST r THEN d `is on or after` r
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE)

GIVEN d IS A DATE, f IS AN `Oz teacher's pension fund`, `under the reform in full from` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the employer's benefits contribution rate under section 46 on` d f `under the reform in full from` IS
    IF f EQUALS `an old pension fund`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE BRANCH
             IF `section 46(ד)(2) applies on` d `under the reform in full from` THEN JUST (7%)
             IF d `is on or after` `the first day of section 46(ד)(1)` THEN JUST (6.5%)
             OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- (1) and (2): the deduction for benefits from the teacher's salary grows
-- by 0.5%, or by what completes it to 5.5% (then to 6%), whichever is
-- lower. A deduction already at or above the figure does not grow, and
-- does not fall either: "יגדל" is a rise, and what completes it is never
-- less than nothing (convention amounts.never-negative). (2)'s rise is on
-- the deduction (1) left. The deduction before 1.1.2011 is the teacher's
-- own, as the fund's rules had it: a fact of the case.
GIVEN deduction IS A NUMBER, ceiling IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the deduction grown under section 46(ד) toward` deduction ceiling IS
    deduction PLUS min (0.5%) (`not below zero` (ceiling MINUS deduction))

`what section 46(ד)(1) completes the deduction to` MEANS 5.5%
`what section 46(ד)(2) completes the deduction to` MEANS 6%

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      f IS AN `Oz teacher's pension fund`
      `the deduction before 1.1.2011` IS A NUMBER @desc the teacher's deduction for benefits on 31.12.2010
      `under the reform in full from` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the teacher's benefits deduction rate under section 46 on` d f `the deduction before 1.1.2011` `under the reform in full from` IS
    IF f EQUALS `an old pension fund`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE BRANCH
             IF `section 46(ד)(2) applies on` d `under the reform in full from`
             THEN JUST (`the deduction grown under section 46(ד) toward` after1 `what section 46(ד)(2) completes the deduction to`)
             IF d `is on or after` `the first day of section 46(ד)(1)`
             THEN JUST after1
             OTHERWISE NOTHING
    WHERE
        after1 MEANS `the deduction grown under section 46(ד) toward` `the deduction before 1.1.2011` `what section 46(ד)(1) completes the deduction to`

§§ `46(ה)`

-- (ה): from the school year תשע"ב, for a teaching employee insured in a
-- pension provident fund that is not an old pension fund, the contribution
-- in place of severance grows to 8 1/3%, and takes the place of all 100% of
-- the severance pay under §14 of the Severance Pay Law, 1963.
@ref akn:art_46__para_e
`the contribution in place of severance under section 46(ה)` MEANS 25 DIVIDED BY 3 DIVIDED BY 100

GIVEN d IS A DATE, f IS AN `Oz teacher's pension fund`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the contribution in place of severance under section 46 on` d f IS
    IF d `is on or after` `section 46 applies from` AND f EQUALS `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund`
    THEN JUST `the contribution in place of severance under section 46(ה)`
    ELSE NOTHING

`the share of the severance pay section 46(ה)'s contribution takes the place of` MEANS 100%

`why section 14 of the Severance Pay Law is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק פיצויי פיטורים, התשכ\"ג-1963, סעיף 14"

§§ `46(ו)`

-- (ו): for the avoidance of doubt, nothing bars contributions for a teaching
-- employee insured in an old pension fund, at his request, to another
-- pension provident fund in place of the old fund, on any salary
-- components, subject to the law. A permission, on his request alone (no
-- deadline: convention dates.no-deadline); what the law allows is outside
-- the corpus.
@ref akn:art_46__para_f
GIVEN f IS AN `Oz teacher's pension fund`, `the teacher asked for it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz section 46 action`
DECIDE `contributing to another fund at the teacher's request` f `the teacher asked for it` IS
    IF f EQUALS `an old pension fund` AND `the teacher asked for it`
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MAY   `contribute for the teacher to another pension provident fund in place of the old pension fund`
    ELSE FULFILLED

`why the law on moving between pension funds is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "הוראות כל דין בעניין הפרשה לקופת גמל לקצבה אחרת במקום לקרן פנסיה ותיקה"

§§ `46 -- the rates on a component`

-- The rates §46 sets for a pension provident fund that is not an old one,
-- on a day from תשע"ב, as §24(ג) asks of them: the employer's for benefits,
-- the teacher's deduction for benefits, and the employer's in place of
-- severance. NOTHING where §46 does not set all three: before תשע"ב, or in
-- an old pension fund.
@desc The pension contribution rates §46 sets on a day, as fractions of the salary component.
DECLARE `Oz pension contribution rates` HAS
    `the employer's for benefits`         IS A NUMBER
    `the teacher's deduction for benefits` IS A NUMBER
    `the employer's in place of severance` IS A NUMBER

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      f IS AN `Oz teacher's pension fund`
      `the deduction before 1.1.2011` IS A NUMBER
      `under the reform in full from` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz pension contribution rates`
DECIDE `the pension contribution rates section 46 sets on` d f `the deduction before 1.1.2011` `under the reform in full from` IS
    CONSIDER `the employer's benefits contribution rate under section 46 on` d f `under the reform in full from`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST employer THEN
        CONSIDER `the teacher's benefits deduction rate under section 46 on` d f `the deduction before 1.1.2011` `under the reform in full from`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
        WHEN JUST teacher THEN
            CONSIDER `the contribution in place of severance under section 46 on` d f
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST severance THEN
                JUST (`Oz pension contribution rates` WITH
                          `the employer's for benefits`          IS employer
                          `the teacher's deduction for benefits` IS teacher
                          `the employer's in place of severance` IS severance)

-- The contributions those rates make on a component of a given amount.
GIVEN r IS AN `Oz pension contribution rates`, amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `Oz pension contribution rates`
DECIDE `the contributions at` r `on` amount IS
    `Oz pension contribution rates` WITH
        `the employer's for benefits`          IS r's `the employer's for benefits` TIMES amount
        `the teacher's deduction for benefits` IS r's `the teacher's deduction for benefits` TIMES amount
        `the employer's in place of severance` IS r's `the employer's in place of severance` TIMES amount

`why an old pension fund's rates are not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "השיעורים הנהוגים לגבי \"רכיבים פנסיוניים\" בקרן הפנסיה הוותיקה שבה מבוטח עובד ההוראה"

§§ `46 -- illustrations`

`the first of September 2011` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011
`a teacher in full from 1.9.2011` MEANS JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011)
`not under the reform in full` MEANS NOTHING

#ASSERT `section 46(א) brings into the pension fund on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011) `another salary component`
#ASSERT NOT `section 46(א) brings into the pension fund on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2011) `another salary component`
#ASSERT NOT `section 46(א) brings into the pension fund on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011) `the clothing allowance`
#ASSERT `the pension contributions section 46 makes on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011) `an expense reimbursement` EQUALS JUST `under the agreement of 17.12.98, at its rates`
#ASSERT `the pension contributions section 46 makes on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011) `a tax gross-up` EQUALS JUST `none under section 46`
#ASSERT `the pension contributions section 46 makes on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2011) `another salary component` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `section 46(ב) replaces the 17.12.98 agreement's contributions on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011) `another salary component` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `section 46(ב) replaces the 17.12.98 agreement's contributions on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011) `the clothing allowance` TRUE
-- the employer: 6.5% in 2011 and 2012, 7% from 2013; 7% already from
-- 1.9.2011 for one in the reform in full from that day
#ASSERT `the employer's benefits contribution rate under section 46 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011) `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` `not under the reform in full` EQUALS JUST (6.5%)
#ASSERT `the employer's benefits contribution rate under section 46 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2012) `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` `not under the reform in full` EQUALS JUST (6.5%)
#ASSERT `the employer's benefits contribution rate under section 46 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` `not under the reform in full` EQUALS JUST (7%)
#ASSERT `the employer's benefits contribution rate under section 46 on` `the first of September 2011` `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` `a teacher in full from 1.9.2011` EQUALS JUST (7%)
#ASSERT `the employer's benefits contribution rate under section 46 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2010) `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` `not under the reform in full` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the employer's benefits contribution rate under section 46 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) `an old pension fund` `not under the reform in full` EQUALS NOTHING
-- the teacher: 5% grows to 5.5% and then 6%; 5.2% to 5.5% (what completes
-- it is the lower); 4% to 4.5% and then 5%; 6.5% stays 6.5%
#ASSERT `the teacher's benefits deduction rate under section 46 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2012) `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` (5%) `not under the reform in full` EQUALS JUST (5.5%)
#ASSERT `the teacher's benefits deduction rate under section 46 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2013) `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` (5%) `not under the reform in full` EQUALS JUST (6%)
#ASSERT `the teacher's benefits deduction rate under section 46 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2012) `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` (5.2%) `not under the reform in full` EQUALS JUST (5.5%)
#ASSERT `the teacher's benefits deduction rate under section 46 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2013) `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` (4%) `not under the reform in full` EQUALS JUST (5%)
#ASSERT `the teacher's benefits deduction rate under section 46 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2013) `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` (6.5%) `not under the reform in full` EQUALS JUST (6.5%)
#ASSERT `the teacher's benefits deduction rate under section 46 on` `the first of September 2011` `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` (5%) `a teacher in full from 1.9.2011` EQUALS JUST (6%)
-- severance: 8 1/3% from תשע"ב in a fund that is not an old one
#ASSERT `the contribution in place of severance under section 46 on` `the first of September 2011` `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` EQUALS JUST (25 DIVIDED BY 3 DIVIDED BY 100)
#ASSERT `the contribution in place of severance under section 46 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2011) `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the contribution in place of severance under section 46 on` `the first of September 2011` `an old pension fund` EQUALS NOTHING
-- on 1,200 at 6.5%, 5.5% and 8 1/3%: 78, 66 and 100
#ASSERT
    CONSIDER `the pension contribution rates section 46 sets on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2012) `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` (5%) `not under the reform in full`
    WHEN JUST r THEN `the contributions at` r `on` 1200 EQUALS
        (`Oz pension contribution rates` WITH
             `the employer's for benefits`          IS 78
             `the teacher's deduction for benefits` IS 66
             `the employer's in place of severance` IS 100)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
#ASSERT `the pension contribution rates section 46 sets on` `the first of September 2011` `an old pension fund` (5%) `not under the reform in full` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `contributing to another fund at the teacher's request` `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` TRUE EQUALS FULFILLED

-- F-oz-founding-46-a's evidence: (א) excepts the grants of §§35 and 36 and
-- not §37's, so by (א)'s words §37's grant carries the pension components'
-- contributions — 7% and 8 1/3% from the employer in a teacher in full
-- from 1.9.2011 — where §37(ג) sets 5% and 5%; the encoding takes §37(ג)'s.
`section 46(א) does not except the grant section 37(ג) sets its own rates for` MEANS
        `section 46(א) brings into the pension fund on` `the first of September 2011` `the alternative allocation of section 37`
    AND `the employer's benefits contribution rate under section 46 on` `the first of September 2011` `a pension provident fund other than an old pension fund` `a teacher in full from 1.9.2011`
            EQUALS JUST (7%)
    AND `the employer's pension contribution rate on the section 37 grant` EQUALS 5%
    AND NOT `section 46(א) brings into the pension fund on` `the first of September 2011` `the evaluation grant of section 35`
    AND NOT `section 46(א) brings into the pension fund on` `the first of September 2011` `the school-achievement grant of section 36`
    AND `the pension contributions section 46 makes on` `the first of September 2011` `the alternative allocation of section 37`
            EQUALS JUST `at the 5% and 5% the component's own section sets`
#ASSERT `section 46(א) does not except the grant section 37(ג) sets its own rates for`

-- And the special reward of annex ו's contract, which (א) brings in by its
-- words, and whose contract sets 5% and 5%.
`section 46(א) does not except the components that set their own rates` MEANS
        `section 46(א) does not except the grant section 37(ג) sets its own rates for`
    AND `section 46(א) brings into the pension fund on` `the first of September 2011` `the special reward of annex ו's special contract`
    AND `the employer's pension contribution on the special reward` EQUALS 5%
    AND `the employee's pension deduction from the special reward` EQUALS 5%
    AND `the pension contributions section 46 makes on` `the first of September 2011` `the special reward of annex ו's special contract`
            EQUALS JUST `at the 5% and 5% the component's own section sets`
#ASSERT `section 46(א) does not except the components that set their own rates`

-- F-oz-founding-46-b's evidence: (ב) and (ג) name two kinds of fund for
-- the one agreement of 17.12.98.
`sections 46(ב) and 46(ג) name two funds for the 17.12.98 agreement's contributions` MEANS
    NOT `the fund section 46(ב) says the 17.12.98 agreement paid into` EQUALS `the fund section 46(ג) has the 17.12.98 agreement's contribution go on to`
#ASSERT `sections 46(ב) and 46(ג) name two funds for the 17.12.98 agreement's contributions`
